{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "On the Phone, Again!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Phrasal Verbs  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " There are various phrasal verbs that are used to talk about different things. Here is list of phrasal verbs for talking on the phone and for talking about health.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A phrasal verb is constructed with a:<br/>verb + particle/preposition<br/> ... to form a different meaning from the verb alone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to get through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've called several times, but I don't seem to be able to get through to the manager.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to hang on/ to hold on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Could you hold on while I look at my schedule?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Could you put me through to customer service please?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Could you speak up? I can hardly hear you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cut off\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hi, I'm calling again because we got cut off somehow.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to build up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> After being sick for a few days, I have to build up my strength again.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put on (weight)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I have to be careful with sweets so that I don't put on weight.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to throw up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I threw up twice last night. I might have the flu.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to catch up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I usually catch up on my sleep on the weekend.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to sleep in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'd better sleep in tomorrow to catch up on my rest.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "If you keep up the stressful work schedule, you burn out eventually.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm tired, but I'm hanging in there.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Zero Conditional  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "  You use the zero conditional when the result of the condition is always true, like a scientific fact.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">The Zero Conditional</span><br/>Notice that you are thinking about a result that is always true for this condition. You are not thinking about the future or the past, or even the present.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: If you don't eat, you will get hungry.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Present Simple tense to write the zero conditional. The important thing about the zero conditional is that the condition always has the same result.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If I keep this phone call short,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> you get back to your work more quickly.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you are stressed all the time,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> you burn out eventually.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> When people get to sleep in,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> they feel a lot better.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to thin out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to gradually decrease in number", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's late, so the dinner crowd is thinning out in the restaurant. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about staying healthy.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to hang in there", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to try hard to continue", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's been a busy and stressful day, but I'm hanging in there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "on top of", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in addition to", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've been on the phone a lot on top of managing the staff.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to keep up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to continue in the same pattern", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you keep up the stress, you burn out eventually.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "off-hours", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the hours away from work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make sure you get some rest in your off-hours to stay healthy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to hang around", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend time in a place in a relaxed manner", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are a few customers still hanging around in the restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to sleep in", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to sleep longer than usual", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If I sleep in tomorrow, I'll be fresh for the evening shift.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue between a restaurant manager and the restaurant owner. You are the manager. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use proper greetings at the beginning and the end of the phone conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about how stressful the job has been.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give advice about how to stay healthy. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use some of the phrasal verbs you have learned in this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue several times with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a phone dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use proper expressions at the beginning and the end of a conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about stress and demands at work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give advice for staying healthy.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice speaking.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le06ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span>: Hello, Vanessa.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello, Mr. Curtis. Nice to hear from you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span> How are you doing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm hanging in there. The dinner crowd is thinning out now. I'm a little flustered today because I've been on the phone so much with different people on top of managing the staff."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "17000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span>: And here you are with another phone call, but that's all part of the job of a manager. We don't have to talk long. When I keep conversations short, employees can get back to work more quickly!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, that's true.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span>: Make sure you get some rest in your off-hours to stay healthy. If you are stressed all the time, you burn out eventually.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If we could have the hostess answer all the phone calls, that would help me focus on my job. I'll try that out."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "48000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span>: In the meantime, don't give up. Are you closing up soon?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. There are a few customers hanging around, but I'm shutting down the cash register.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span>: Sounds good. If you wrap up soon, you'll get to bed earlier.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's true. If I sleep in tomorrow, I'll be fresh for the evening shift.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span>: OK. Take care, Vanessa. We'll connect tomorrow.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Right. Thanks for calling, Mr. Curtis.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Curtis</span>: Have a good night.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You too, sir."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can start and end a conversation on the phone. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about staying healthy. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can give advice and talk about cause and effect.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How many hours a night do you sleep?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you do in your hours away from school or your job to relax?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorre